<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen ends higher on possible weak tankan.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen ends higher on possible weak tankan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>June 24 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (Z)	98.94		   98.87</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Key March three-month Euroyen interest rate futures settled higher on Tuesday on last-minute dealer purchases ahead of the release of the Bank of Japan's quarterly &quot;tankan&quot; corporate sentiment survey on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The March was earlier lifted by various market rumours about possible weakness in the tankan. Better-than-expected results at a 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) auction this afternoon gave additional support, traders said.</p>
